{"4133290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DownSouth", "steam_appid": 4133290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DownSouth</strong> is a <strong>morality-driven Platformer/RPG.</strong> Play as <strong><i>South, </i></strong><i>a stimulant-fueled</i> <i>purple bean, </i>and parkour, converse and fight your way through sprawling dystopian city-scapes. Each choice affects your abilities, dialogue, and even your appearance... Just know, <u><i><strong>SURVIVAL comes at a moral cost.</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/extras/bd9e02cd6496dbd730a841aa1338477e.poster.avif?t=1785996145\" width=892 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/extras/bd9e02cd6496dbd730a841aa1338477e.webm?t=1785996145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/extras/bd9e02cd6496dbd730a841aa1338477e.mp4?t=1785996145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MORALITY &amp; GAMEPLAY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>high sanity, South is a brightly coloured speed-demon:</strong> <i>fast and versatile</i> with access to a wide array of dialogue options and movement fluidity... but he's fragile, vulnerable, easily manipulated, and poorly equipped to brute-force dangerous foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <i><strong>South's 'Soul Points' degrade:</strong> </i>His colours fade, fluidity falters, dialogue options disappear... What remains is a devoid<strong>, uncommunicative killing machine.</strong> Powerful, efficient, and increasingly detached from the world around him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Using up to 5 dialogue options, <strong>you'll constantly weigh empathy against self preservation,</strong> deciding whether other lives matter more than your own survival.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/extras/f964c8df85d8c43c9b8f48c107ac15d4.poster.avif?t=1785996145\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/extras/f964c8df85d8c43c9b8f48c107ac15d4.webm?t=1785996145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/extras/f964c8df85d8c43c9b8f48c107ac15d4.mp4?t=1785996145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SIDE EFFECTS OF THIS EXPERIENCE WILL INCLUDE:☺</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frame-by-frame, hand drawn <strong>pixel-art animation.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed dystopian worlds</strong> full of bizarre, comedic &amp; morally dubious characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching dialogue and a <strong>sanity system</strong> that permanently alters the narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of main clients and characters that you may <strong>befriend, battle or kill.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expressive platforming</strong> mechanics and a plethora of hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradeable abilities, <strong>fluid movement,</strong> and combo-chaining combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moral dilemmas that evolve based on your every choice.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/extras/d69188a7545505c865c4e5657c416b5b.poster.avif?t=1785996145\" width=1170 height=1254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/extras/d69188a7545505c865c4e5657c416b5b.webm?t=1785996145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/extras/d69188a7545505c865c4e5657c416b5b.mp4?t=1785996145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DownSouth</strong> is a <strong>morality-driven Platformer/RPG.</strong> Play as <strong><i>South, </i></strong><i>a stimulant-fueled</i> <i>purple bean, </i>and parkour, converse and fight your way through sprawling dystopian city-scapes. Each choice affects your abilities, dialogue, and even your appearance... Just know, <u><i><strong>SURVIVAL comes at a moral cost.</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/extras/bd9e02cd6496dbd730a841aa1338477e.poster.avif?t=1785996145\" width=892 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/extras/bd9e02cd6496dbd730a841aa1338477e.webm?t=1785996145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/extras/bd9e02cd6496dbd730a841aa1338477e.mp4?t=1785996145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MORALITY &amp; GAMEPLAY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>high sanity, South is a brightly coloured speed-demon:</strong> <i>fast and versatile</i> with access to a wide array of dialogue options and movement fluidity... but he's fragile, vulnerable, easily manipulated, and poorly equipped to brute-force dangerous foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <i><strong>South's 'Soul Points' degrade:</strong> </i>His colours fade, fluidity falters, dialogue options disappear... What remains is a devoid<strong>, uncommunicative killing machine.</strong> Powerful, efficient, and increasingly detached from the world around him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Using up to 5 dialogue options, <strong>you'll constantly weigh empathy against self preservation,</strong> deciding whether other lives matter more than your own survival.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/extras/f964c8df85d8c43c9b8f48c107ac15d4.poster.avif?t=1785996145\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/extras/f964c8df85d8c43c9b8f48c107ac15d4.webm?t=1785996145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/extras/f964c8df85d8c43c9b8f48c107ac15d4.mp4?t=1785996145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SIDE EFFECTS OF THIS EXPERIENCE WILL INCLUDE:☺</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frame-by-frame, hand drawn <strong>pixel-art animation.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed dystopian worlds</strong> full of bizarre, comedic &amp; morally dubious characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching dialogue and a <strong>sanity system</strong> that permanently alters the narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of main clients and characters that you may <strong>befriend, battle or kill.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expressive platforming</strong> mechanics and a plethora of hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradeable abilities, <strong>fluid movement,</strong> and combo-chaining combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moral dilemmas that evolve based on your every choice.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/extras/d69188a7545505c865c4e5657c416b5b.poster.avif?t=1785996145\" width=1170 height=1254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/extras/d69188a7545505c865c4e5657c416b5b.webm?t=1785996145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/extras/d69188a7545505c865c4e5657c416b5b.mp4?t=1785996145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "DownSouth is a moral-dilemma platformer RPG where your choices affect your sanity, and your sanity affects how you play.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“The art here looks amazing. Very pretty in a zany and crazy way.”<br>ABC News<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/208d8533573b469ba640d7ab6abec4049b7932c6/header.jpg?t=1785996145", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/ca190eebbf1dddbc05d22436678091b783b9229a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785996145", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133290/ca190eebbf1dddbc05d22436678091b783b9229a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785996145", "website": "https://troopsushi.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or AMD Duel Core CPU<br></li><li